        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">		1. ”Move the Plot Forward” Rau, Malus</Text>
      </Paragraph>
