        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">		3. ”Amount to Anything” Pyrus</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">		4. ”Grow a Pair” Pyrus, Parsley</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">		5. ”Test the Water” Parsley</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">		6. ”Photosynthesis” Parsley, Pyrus</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">		7. ”Crop Top” Pyrus, Parsley</Text>
      </Paragraph>
